{"3434920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "SAGE", "steam_appid": 3434920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into <i>SAGE</i>, a multiplayer adventure game about frog wizards. Play solo or with up to 12 other wizards on a journey to become a SAGE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/a2a7312270c7df118567935d79ee7c10.poster.avif?t=1783042021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/a2a7312270c7df118567935d79ee7c10.webm?t=1783042021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/a2a7312270c7df118567935d79ee7c10.mp4?t=1783042021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a living world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Becoming a SAGE means growing your magic  and learning to navigate the world. Progress from Novice to SAGE and unlock new magical abilities as you help the creatures of the forest amidst a rising darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/08490b2d677d56231bedff4608cacad4.poster.avif?t=1783042021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/08490b2d677d56231bedff4608cacad4.webm?t=1783042021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/08490b2d677d56231bedff4608cacad4.mp4?t=1783042021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SAGE takes place in a world where weather and encounters are constantly shifting. You will explore to find resources, puzzles, and ingredients for fragrant teas to share with fellow adventurers. A cast of villagers and merchants will seek your help and guide you along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/e1015ae18d11df072c1090d12bb37470.poster.avif?t=1783042021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/e1015ae18d11df072c1090d12bb37470.webm?t=1783042021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/e1015ae18d11df072c1090d12bb37470.mp4?t=1783042021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy hangout spots!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun co-op mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public and private lobbies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many tea recipes and spells to learn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your staff and companions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of unique cosmetic combinations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with emotes and animations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storybook-inspired visuals and a vibey soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/da0320fcb7b192fce3d8bb19635ce880.avif?t=1783042021\" width=617 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop into <i>SAGE</i>, a multiplayer adventure game about frog wizards. Play solo or with up to 12 other wizards on a journey to become a SAGE.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/a2a7312270c7df118567935d79ee7c10.poster.avif?t=1783042021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/a2a7312270c7df118567935d79ee7c10.webm?t=1783042021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/a2a7312270c7df118567935d79ee7c10.mp4?t=1783042021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore a living world</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Becoming a SAGE means growing your magic  and learning to navigate the world. Progress from Novice to SAGE and unlock new magical abilities as you help the creatures of the forest amidst a rising darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/08490b2d677d56231bedff4608cacad4.poster.avif?t=1783042021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/08490b2d677d56231bedff4608cacad4.webm?t=1783042021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/08490b2d677d56231bedff4608cacad4.mp4?t=1783042021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Master the elements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SAGE takes place in a world where weather and encounters are constantly shifting. You will explore to find resources, puzzles, and ingredients for fragrant teas to share with fellow adventurers. A cast of villagers and merchants will seek your help and guide you along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/e1015ae18d11df072c1090d12bb37470.poster.avif?t=1783042021\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/e1015ae18d11df072c1090d12bb37470.webm?t=1783042021\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/e1015ae18d11df072c1090d12bb37470.mp4?t=1783042021\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cozy hangout spots!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun co-op mechanics!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Public and private lobbies!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many tea recipes and spells to learn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your staff and companions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hundreds of unique cosmetic combinations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Express yourself with emotes and animations!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Storybook-inspired visuals and a vibey soundtrack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/extras/da0320fcb7b192fce3d8bb19635ce880.avif?t=1783042021\" width=617 height=164 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>", "short_description": "SAGE is a multiplayer adventure game about frog wizards. Play solo or with up to 12 other mages on a journey to learn spells and heal the forest. Complete bounties, brew fragrant teas, and master the elements to push back a growing darkness.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/header.jpg?t=1783042021", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/5cb6508b1b3df9e4831165982bfe68e3d75d6e7b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783042021", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3434920/5cb6508b1b3df9e4831165982bfe68e3d75d6e7b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783042021", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce GTX 960 / AMD Radeon RX 570<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Bender Games"], "publishers": ["Bender Games"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 48, "description": "LAN Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 55, "description": "Du